{% from "_macros.html.j2" import icon with context %}
<section class="alerts" aria-labelledby="alerts-title">
  {% if site.PUSH_PUBLIC_KEY %}
  <h2 id="alerts-title">新消息一出來就通知你</h2>
  <p>開啟推播後，新的消息一發布，手機或電腦就會跳出通知。也可以用 RSS 訂閱。</p>
  {% else %}
  <h2 id="alerts-title">訂閱新消息</h2>
  <p>把訂閱網址加進 RSS 閱讀器，新的消息與文獻會自動出現。</p>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="alerts__actions">
    <button class="btn btn--primary" type="button" data-push-toggle hidden>{{ icon("bell") }}<span data-push-label>開啟推播</span></button>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ url(feed_path(site.NEWS_CATEGORY) if feed_path(site.NEWS_CATEGORY) in feeds else '/rss.xml') }}">{{ icon("rss") }}RSS</a>
    <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="{{ url('/subscribe/') }}">依主題訂閱</a>
  </div>
  <p class="alerts__status" data-push-status role="status"></p>
</section>
